  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e by reading every io_primitives/*.yaml: resource_naming appears on 4 rows only (c stdio, c fcntl, c unistd, go net), 31 function entries, of which only fflush and the five net.Dial* are class R. None of the ten largest un-annotated members named in the statement (httpc.request, mnesia.*, bash redirect, net/http.NewRequest/Client.Do, builtins.print, sys/socket.sendmsg, stdio.printf) carries an annotation. Since filing WI-bulub (35fb62168c) added class-D open/openat/creat, which suppresses nothing. The 100/584 corpus counts were not re-measured here. MECHANISM: catalogue rows lack a resource_naming signature classification, so un-annotated sinks count every flow as evidence."  # c881
